// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Foundations — Life Sciences (fl01-fl35)
// Intro-level biology for high schoolers heading into undergrad: cell biology,
// genetics, human body systems, ecology, and evolution basics. Deliberately
// kept at Easy/Medium — no MCAT-depth biochemistry here (see bioBiochem.js for
// that tier). These are the building blocks students need before they're
// ready for the harder quizzes in the rest of the library.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

